	"CH2_LAMPS": "Lamps earned on the mainland: %d of %d", "CH2_NEXT": "Chapter 3 · The Substation", "CH2_SOON": "Mill Town wants a substation: bays, a bus scheme and protection that trips one feeder instead of the whole town. And the 46 kvar your cable charges comes back as reactive power.",
	"CH3_TITLE": "Mill Town runs clean", "CH3_SUB": "Chapter 3 · Phasors and Power Factor, complete", "CH3_LAMPS": "Lamps earned in Mill Town: %d of %d", "CH3_NEXT": "Chapter 4 · Three-Phase and Machines", "CH3_SOON": "The industrial belt: three phases, a neutral that can burn, motors that start hard and a generator over the hill.", "CH3_PREVIEW": "Take the next job", "CH3_STAY": "Stay in Mill Town",
	"CH3_NIA": "Physics today: the teacher drew the power triangle and I said 'that is the mill at lunch'. Q is the current that does no work but still heats the wire.",
	"CH4_TITLE": "Three phases in step", "CH4_SUB": "Chapter 4 · Three-Phase and Machines, complete", "CH4_LAMPS": "Lamps earned on the belt: %d of %d", "CH4_NEXT": "Chapter 5 · Load Flow and Voltage", "CH4_SOON": "The state ring: per-unit, load flow, taps and reactors, and the nose of the P-V curve.", "CH4_PREVIEW": "Take the next job", "CH4_STAY": "Stay on the belt",
	"CH4_NIA": "Balanced phases cancel in the neutral. I drew the three arrows tip to tail and they closed. Then I drew the street with everyone on phase a and the neutral caught fire, on paper.",
	"CH5_TITLE": "The ring holds its voltage", "CH5_SUB": "Chapter 5 · Load Flow and Voltage, complete", "CH5_LAMPS": "Lamps earned on the ring: %d of %d", "CH5_NEXT": "Chapter 6 · Frequency and Renewables", "CH5_SOON": "The solar desert: inertia, droop, reserves, and the evening when the sun goes down.", "CH5_PREVIEW": "Take the next job", "CH5_STAY": "Stay on the ring",
	"CH5_NIA": "A long line at no load lifts its far end (Ferranti). A heavy one sags until it falls off the nose. Voltage is a reactive-power story.",
	"CH6_TITLE": "Fifty hertz, every second", "CH6_SUB": "Chapter 6 · Frequency and Renewables, complete", "CH6_LAMPS": "Lamps earned in the desert: %d of %d", "CH6_NEXT": "Chapter 7 · Protection and Markets", "CH6_SOON": "The interconnect: fault currents, relays that grade, the clearing time, and who runs at what price.", "CH6_PREVIEW": "Take the next job", "CH6_STAY": "Stay in the desert",
	"CH6_NIA": "Frequency is the whole grid's heartbeat: every spinning machine slows a little when one trips. Spinning mass buys you seconds; droop shares the gap.",
	"CH7_TITLE": "The grid protects itself", "CH7_SUB": "Chapter 7 · Protection and Markets, complete", "CH7_LAMPS": "Lamps earned on the interconnect: %d of %d", "CH7_NEXT": "Finale · Keep the Lights On", "CH7_SOON": "The whole state, three days: a heatwave, a storm with three trips and lightning, and a holiday full of sun.", "CH7_PREVIEW": "Take the finale", "CH7_STAY": "Stay on the interconnect",
